    <string name="about_app_dialog_body">"Version %1$s

PillSOS is your daily companion for medication management and mutual safety with the people you care about most.

⚠️ IMPORTANT NOTICE
PillSOS is a personal reminder and peer aid, NOT a certified medical device or life-safety system. It does not replace emergency response services (112 / 911) and cannot guarantee timely delivery of alerts, which depends on connectivity and third-party relays (ntfy.sh).

🎨 CREDITS &amp; ATTRIBUTIONS
• Icon: Peing
• Sound effects: freesound.org

❤️ Developed with care by SwimminSparrow"</string>
